    "In more advanced or agentic setups, augmentation may include reasoning steps.",
    "The augmented prompt, consisting of the query plus retrieved private-doc context, is sent to the generator.",
    "The generator produces the final response grounded in the private documents.",
    "This final generation step completes the RAG pipeline.",
    "Retrieval pulls relevant private-doc chunks as vectors and loads their text.",
    "Augmentation attaches that private-doc text to the query as additional knowledge.",
    "Generation produces the response using the augmented, private-doc-grounded context."
] 

